{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System benchmark that test CPU/GPU/RAM-BUS all together and detects the bottleneck device in your PC in terms of gaming/AI heavy loads equivalent scenarios. Main components(CPU, GPU, RAM together with motherboard BUS) are ranked in corespondence to each other so the weakest components in the PC can be indentified.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This app needs &quot;Microsoft OpenCL, OpenGL and Vulkan compatibility pack&quot; provided free by Microsoft corporation(in Microsoft Store or via Store webpage - link to download provided in app) to be installed. It is required to execute a balanced benchmark test on all platforms.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069200?t=1760704793","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069200?t=1760704793","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069200/13551173966141f1513180290138f94139d7ced1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760704793","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069200/13551173966141f1513180290138f94139d7ced1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760704793","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System benchmark that test CPU/GPU/RAM-BUS all together and detects the bottleneck device in your PC in terms of gaming/AI heavy loads equivalent scenarios. Main components(CPU, GPU, RAM together with motherboard BUS) are ranked in corespondence to each other so the weakest components in the PC can be indentified.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This app needs &quot;Microsoft OpenCL, OpenGL and Vulkan compatibility pack&quot; provided free by Microsoft corporation(in Microsoft Store or via Store webpage - link to download provided in app) to be installed. It is required to execute a balanced benchmark test on all platforms.</p>","developers":["DPC23"],"genres":[{"descri